         {
          "text": "Confirmed with a manual test:  Deny access to object /test:1/.* (anyURI-regexp-match) and /test:1 (anyURI-equal) results in access to the object, datastreams, listMethods being denied, but access to the system disseminator via /objects/test:1/methods/fedora-system:3/viewDublinCore is incorrectly allowed.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
